<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Huntington price target up.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Huntington price target up.</headline>
<text>
<p>--EVEREN Securities Inc said Tuesday it increased its price targets for Huntington Bancshares Inc shares to $29 from $26 for the six months and to $31 from $28 for the 18 months.</p>
<p>--&quot;Our price targets project that Huntington's 1998 PE ratio will be unchaged during the next six months at 12.4 times, or a 68 percent relative multiple versus the overall market,&quot; EVEREN said in a report.</p>
<p>--Huntington Bancshares was up 1/4 at 28-3/8.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
